│ 

│   on ../../modules/bastion/main.tf line 34, in resource "aws_security_group_rule" "allow_bastion_to_eks":

│   34:   source_security_group_id = aws_security_group.bastion_sg

│     ├────────────────

│     │ aws_security_group.bastion_sg is object with 13 attributes

