Now you can run the two-terminal setup to establish your proxy tunnel and execute terraform apply for your cluster resources (like Karpenter).

Step 1: Start the SSM Tunnel (Terminal 1)
Execute the port-forwarding command in Terminal 1 and leave it running in the background:

Bash
aws ssm start-session \
  --region us-east-1 \
  --target i-0f935f451f27d0a59 \
  --document-name AWS-StartPortForwardingSessionToRemoteHost \
