Port 8443 opened for sessionId ...
Waiting for connections...
aws eks update-kubeconfig --name prod-eks-karpenter && kubectl config set-cluster arn:aws:eks:us-east-1:$(aws sts get-caller-identity --query Account --output text):cluster/prod-eks-karpenter --server=https://localhost:8443

