Check that your system node pool and Karpenter controller pod are up and running:

Bash
kubectl get pods -n karpenter
kubectl get nodepools,nodeclasses
Deploy a Test Workload (Optional Validation)
Apply a simple deployment targeting the Karpenter-managed nodes to watch dynamic provisioners spin up Bottlerocket capacity on demand.

